<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Struggling Rainbow Chicken appoints new MD.</title>
<headline>Struggling Rainbow Chicken appoints new MD.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rainbow Chicken Ltd said on Tuesday it had appointed Jorge Antonio Del Corral Ibarrondo as its new managing director, effective from mid-November.</p>
</text>
